---
// Side-by-side Go code trace vs animated runtime iface boxing flow for typed nil error trap.
const W = 900;
const H = 350;
---
<figure class="gact">
  <div class="gact-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Side-by-side code trace comparing returning a typed nil pointer *ValidationError as an error interface on the left to runtime.iface tab and data packing on the right.">
      {/* Left panel: Go code */}
      <rect x="14" y="16" width="386" height="316" rx="10" class="gact-panel" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="gact-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Go code (returning var err *ValErr)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Code Go (trả biến con trỏ *ValErr)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="26" y="56" width="362" height="36" rx="6" class="gact-line-box" />
      <text x="36" y="78" class="gact-num">L1</text>
      <text x="60" y="78" class="gact-code">func validate(s string) error {'{'}</text>

      <rect x="26" y="98" width="362" height="44" rx="6" class="gact-line-box is-warn" />
      <text x="36" y="116" class="gact-num-warn">L2</text>
      <text x="60" y="116" class="gact-code">var err *ValErr // zero value: nil</text>
      <text x="60" y="134" class="gact-sm">static concrete type = *ValErr</text>

      <rect x="26" y="148" width="362" height="36" rx="6" class="gact-line-box" />
      <text x="36" y="170" class="gact-num">L3</text>
      <text x="60" y="170" class="gact-code">if s == "" {'{'} err = &amp;ValErr{'{'}...{'}'} {'}'}</text>

      <rect x="26" y="190" width="362" height="44" rx="6" class="gact-line-box is-red" />
      <text x="36" y="208" class="gact-num-red">L4</text>
      <text x="60" y="208" class="gact-code-red">return err      // boxes (*ValErr, 0x0)</text>
      <text x="60" y="226" class="gact-red">caller: if err != nil {'{'} ... {'}'} -&gt; TRUE!</text>

      <rect x="26" y="250" width="362" height="66" rx="6" class="gact-line-box is-ok" />
      <text x="38" y="274" class="gact-ok">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Fix: return nil directly when no error occurs</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cách sửa: không có lỗi thì viết thẳng return nil</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="294" class="gm-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Never declare var err *MyErr and return it</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Không khai báo var err *MyErr rồi return thẳng</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Connector wires */}
      <path d="M 388 120 L 452 108" class="gact-wire is-warn" />
      <path d="M 388 212 L 452 178" class="gact-wire is-red" />

      {/* Right panel: runtime.iface flow */}
      <rect x="454" y="16" width="432" height="316" rx="10" class="gact-panel" />
      <text x="470" y="42" class="gact-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Runtime iface boxing flow</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Luồng đóng gói runtime.iface ở runtime</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="468" y="64" width="380" height="58" rx="6" class="gact-step" />
      <text x="480" y="87" class="gact-b">① L2–L3 (s="ok"): err pointer stays 0x0</text>
      <text x="480" y="107" class="gact-sm">
        <tspan data-lang-en>err == nil as *ValErr, yet carries concrete type</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>con trỏ *ValErr là nil, nhưng mang sẵn kiểu</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="468" y="136" width="380" height="66" rx="6" class="gact-step is-red" />
      <text x="480" y="159" class="gact-red">② L4 return converts *ValErr → interface</text>
      <text x="480" y="180" class="gact-code-red">iface.tab = &amp;itab(*ValErr, error) // ≠ 0!</text>
      <text x="480" y="194" class="gact-sm">iface.data = 0x0 (nil pointer inside)</text>

      <rect x="468" y="216" width="380" height="66" rx="6" class="gact-step is-red" />
      <text x="480" y="239" class="gact-red">③ Caller: if err != nil checks (tab != 0)</text>
      <text x="480" y="260" class="gact-sm">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Because iface.tab != 0, err != nil runs true!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Vì iface.tab != 0 nên if err != nil chạy thật!</tspan>
      </text>

      <line x1="864" x2="864" y1="90" y2="256" class="gact-rail" />
      <polygon points="864,262 859,253 869,253" class="gact-dot-red" />

      <text x="670" y="312" text-anchor="middle" class="gact-note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Rule: interface == nil ONLY when BOTH tab == 0 AND data == 0</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Quy tắc: interface == nil CHỈ KHI cả tab == 0 LẪN data == 0</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Tracing typed nil across return boundaries: converting (*ValErr)(nil) into an error interface populates iface.tab, making err != nil evaluate true inside the caller.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Theo dấu lỗi typed nil qua lệnh return: gán con trỏ (*ValErr)(nil) vào kiểu trả về error làm iface.tab khác 0, khiến if err != nil ở hàm gọi nhảy nhầm vào nhánh lỗi.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gact { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gact-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gact svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gact text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gact-panel { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .gact-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gact-line-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gact-line-box.is-warn { stroke: var(--gold); }
  .gact-line-box.is-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .gact-line-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gact-line-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gact-step { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gact-step.is-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .gact-num, .gact-num-warn, .gact-num-red { font-weight: 800; font-size: 11px; }
  .gact-num { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gact-num-warn { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .gact-num-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .gact-code, .gact-code-red { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 11.2px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .gact-code-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .gact-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gact-red { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gact-ok { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gact-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gact-sm, .gm-sub { font-size: 11px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gact-note { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gact-wire { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gact-wire.is-warn { stroke: var(--gold); }
  .gact-wire.is-red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .gact-rail { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; opacity: 0.45; }
  .gact-dot-warn { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .gact-dot-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .gact figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
